{"corpus":"ccc","number":693,"text_html":"<span>Outre son nom propre, qui est le plus employé dans les Actes des apôtres et les Épîtres, on trouve chez saint Paul les appellations : l’Esprit de la promesse <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"2\">2</sup>, l’Esprit d’adoption <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"3\">3</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"4\">4</sup>, l’Esprit du Christ <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"5\">5</sup>, l’Esprit du Seigneur <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"6\">6</sup>, l’Esprit de Dieu <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"7\">7</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"8\">8</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"9\">9</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"10\">10</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"11\">11</sup>, et chez saint Pierre, l’Esprit de gloire <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"12\">12</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":[],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Ga 3:14"},{"text":"Ep 1:13"},{"text":"Rm 8:15"},{"text":"Ga 4:6"},{"text":"Rm 8:11"},{"text":"2 Co 3:17"},{"text":"Rm 8:9"},{"text":"Rm 8:14"},{"text":"Rm 15:19"},{"text":"1 Co 6:11"},{"text":"1 Co 7:40"},{"text":"1 Co 1 P 4:14"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"Ga 3:14","idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Ep 1:13","idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"Rm 8:15","idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"Ga 4:6","idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"Rm 8:11","idx":5},{"type":"bible","raw":"2 Co 3:17","idx":6},{"type":"bible","raw":"Rm 8:9","idx":7},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"8:14","idx":8},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"15:19","idx":9},{"type":"bible","raw":"1 Co 6:11","idx":10},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"7:40","idx":11},{"type":"bible","raw":"1 P 4:14","idx":12}]}